    "detailed_description": "In Warpflux you assume the role of the only living officer aboard an autonomous colony ship. The destination? A new birthplace for humanity. Take command and decide the best course of action during the thousand-year long voyage full of perils. <br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Defend against enemies during an intense, time-limited resource gathering phase<br></li><li> Carefully plan and manage a limited number of actions before entering cryo sleep<br></li><li> Collect research and use it to unlock new upgrades <br></li><li> Encounter crisis events and make tough decisions<br></li><li> Explore procedurally generated solar systems</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In Warpflux you assume the role of the only living officer aboard an autonomous colony ship. The destination? A new birthplace for humanity. Take command and decide the best course of action during the thousand-year long voyage full of perils. <br><br>Features<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Defend against enemies during an intense, time-limited resource gathering phase<br></li><li> Carefully plan and manage a limited number of actions before entering cryo sleep<br></li><li> Collect research and use it to unlock new upgrades <br></li><li> Encounter crisis events and make tough decisions<br></li><li> Explore procedurally generated solar systems</li></ul>",
